                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A trellis or trellis-like structure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "306f947e-61db-4cb0-812f-87a70d16d849",
                                                "sense_id": "b8ddb37f-6d46-3693-86d4-08ee0f9a284a",
                                                "text": "[…] the trellis-work of lace and ruffles […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b749811-96a3-4b01-9a5c-c417ccc24cf4",
                                                "sense_id": "b8ddb37f-6d46-3693-86d4-08ee0f9a284a",
                                                "text": "Through leaves and trellis-work the sun\nLeft the wine cool within the glass,—\nThey feasting where no sun could pass: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e544ac05-8a36-43a3-852e-5ff75175e390",
                                                "sense_id": "b8ddb37f-6d46-3693-86d4-08ee0f9a284a",
                                                "text": "1932, Arthur G. Chater (translator), The Burning Bush (Den brændende busk) (1930) by Sigrid Undset, New York: Knopf, Book One, Chapter Five, p. 96,\nPaul strolled about the garden and watched the stars coming out above the intricate trellis-work of the apple-trees’ branches."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "206e2ca6-1eab-4236-b655-37ff9e124527",
                                                "sense_id": "b8ddb37f-6d46-3693-86d4-08ee0f9a284a",
                                                "text": "Wavy panels made of steel trelliswork hang from the entry’s ceiling; big squat columns frame views to a small public garden outside."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
